		<name>Molly (Molly4Watch)</name>
		<summary>Molly with a Pixel Watch companion gateway</summary>
		<desc>Molly, the hardened Signal fork, with a small signature-protected gateway that lets the
Molly Wear relay show your chats on a Pixel Watch.

* Install &quot;Molly Wear relay&quot; from this repo too, and the watch app from the GitHub release.
* Signed with this project's own key: it cannot update the official Molly. Make a backup,
  uninstall Molly, install this one, then restore.
* Built against Signal's official libsignal while Molly's artifacts are unavailable, so
  Molly's proxy-only libsignal change is not included yet.

Unofficial build, not affiliated with or endorsed by the Molly project.</desc>
