		<name>Molly Wear relay</name>
		<summary>Bridges Molly and your Pixel Watch</summary>
		<desc>Phone-side helper for Molly4Watch. It talks to the Molly Wear app on your watch over the
Wear Data Layer and reads your chats from Molly through a local, same-key-only channel.

* Nothing is shown on the watch while Molly is locked.
* Needs the &quot;Molly (Molly4Watch)&quot; app from this repo (same signing key).
* Install the watch app from the GitHub release: https://github.com/TheWindWalkerX/Molly4Watch/releases/latest</desc>
